msgctxt "quest/048/AktKct303_04804:TEXT_AKTKCT303_04804_CHORAZOI_000_013:1"
msgid "And if we're to obtain those components, we'll need you to craft the finest trade goods Norvrandt has to offer. A shipment of <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 41262 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 2)><noun-en Item 3 41263 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 3)><noun-en Item 3 41264 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 4)><noun-en Item 3 41265 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 5)><noun-en Item 3 41266 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 6)><noun-en Item 3 41267 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 7)><noun-en Item 3 41268 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 8)><noun-en Item 3 41269 2 1></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if> should be enough to satisfy the Boutique!"
msgstr "Чтобы получить эти материалы, вам нужно изготовить лучшие товары, какие только есть в Норврандте. Партии <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 41262 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 2)><noun-en Item 3 41263 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 3)><noun-en Item 3 41264 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 4)><noun-en Item 3 41265 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 5)><noun-en Item 3 41266 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 6)><noun-en Item 3 41267 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 7)><noun-en Item 3 41268 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 8)><noun-en Item 3 41269 2 1></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if> должно хватить, чтобы удовлетворить потребности мастерской!"

#. ja: 今回稀少材料としてご用意いただきたいのは、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と、<br>「<sheet Item $n2 0>」ですっ！
#. de: Also dann. Als Sonderkomponente brauchen wir <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> und <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 4 1>!
#. fr: Hmm, voyons voirrr... Si je ne me trompe pas, vous allez devoir me rapporter <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 2 1> et <noun-fr Item 1 $n2 2 1>.
#. speaker: CHORAZOI
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/AktKct303_04804:TEXT_AKTKCT303_04804_CHORAZOI_000_014:1"
msgid "To complete this tool, we'll need─yes, you guessed it─the finest components that Mistress Qeshi-Trao can provide. Specifically, <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> and <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1>!"
msgstr "Чтобы довести инструмент до совершенства, нам понадобятся лучшие материалы от госпожи Кеши-Трао. А именно: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> и <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1>!"

#. ja: それらの稀少材料を商会から提供してもらうには、<br>取引資本に「<if ($n1 == 9)><sheet ItemMP 41290 0><else><if ($n1 == 10)><sheet ItemMP 41292 0></if></if>」を、<br>ご調達いただければ！
#. de: Als entsprechendes Tauschgut dafür müsstest du <if ($n1 == 9)><noun-de ItemMP 5 41290 2 4 1><else><if ($n1 == 10)><noun-de ItemMP 5 41292 2 4 1></if></if> an die Handelsgesellschaft liefern!
#. fr: En échange des matériaux rares fournis par Qeshi-Trao, la maison des merrrveilles demande <if ($n1 == 9)><noun-fr Item 1 41290 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 10)><noun-fr Item 1 41292 2 1></if></if>. À vous de les récolter avec vos petites mains bourrées de talent<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CHORAZOI
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 9)><noun-en Item 3 41290 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 10)><noun-en Item 3 41292 2 1></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 9 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 41290 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 41290, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
